<title>USA: Gainsco sees 1996 shr between $0.70-$0.75.</title>
<headline>Gainsco sees 1996 shr between $0.70-$0.75.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gainsco Inc said on Monday that a preliminary review showed its earnings for 1996 would total between $0.70 and $0.75 a share.</p>
<p>In February, the company reported earnings for 1995 at $0.81 a share.</p>
<p>Gainsco also said gross premiums written of $110 million for the year ended December 31 were slightly higher than the $108.1 million for 1995.</p>
<p>The property and casualty insurance holding company said it had repurchased 470,702 shares under the previously announced 500,000 share stock repurchase program.</p>
</text>
